{"id":"2d66c874fb7ff31a","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Pointclass Closure Under Projection","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection — ZFC Descriptive4 Pointclass Closure Under Projection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection — ZFC Descriptive4 Pointclass Closure Under Projection","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-projection.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection — ZFC Descriptive4 Pointclass Closure Under Projection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" href=\"?note=e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-projection.md\">../batch13/58-df-projection.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Cls}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Cls}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(X)\">\\(\\Gamma(X)\\)</span> 表示空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的点类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X(A)\">\\(\\pi_X(A)\\)</span> 为二元关系向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的投影（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" href=\"?note=e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-projection.md\">../batch13/58-df-projection.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderProjection}_S:\\mathrm{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderProjection}_S:\\mathrm{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}pointclass\\text{-}closure\\text{-}under\\text{-}projection} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderProjection}_S(\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Cls}\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall Z\\in V\\;\\Gamma(Z)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Z)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in V\\;\\forall A\\subseteq X\\times Y\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in\\Gamma(X\\times Y)\\to\\pi_X(A)\\in\\Gamma(X)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}pointclass\\text{-}closure\\text{-}under\\text{-}projection} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderProjection}_S(\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Cls}\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall Z\\in V\\;\\Gamma(Z)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Z)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in V\\;\\forall A\\subseteq X\\times Y\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in\\Gamma(X\\times Y)\\to\\pi_X(A)\\in\\Gamma(X)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>点类是按空间索引的类级指派，不能伪装成以真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为定义域的集合函数；因此定义标为类元理论陈述，而闭包条件本身仅量化集合空间与其二元关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-projection.md","status":"resolved","id":"e8edb0ea1617bd4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-projection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-projection.md","status":"resolved","id":"e8edb0ea1617bd4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi_X(A)$ 为二元关系向 $X$ 的投影（see [[../batch13/58-df-projection.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P:V\\to V$（see [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X(A)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderProjection}_S:\\mathrm{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}pointclass\\text{-}closure\\text{-}under\\text{-}projection} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderProjection}_S(\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Cls}\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall Z\\in V\\;\\Gamma(Z)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Z)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in V\\;\\forall A\\subseteq X\\times Y\\;\n\\bigl(A\\in\\Gamma(X\\times Y)\\to\\pi_X(A)\\in\\Gamma(X)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1515,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1845","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-projection]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["e8edb0ea1617bd4e","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}